{
  "id": "797",
  "title": "Half Per Person?",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2020-01-26",
  "synopsis": "Paul and Little Le are deciding how to pay a restaurant bill.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/797/8fe3db8bc3b08facbb139b21483e4c4533530621.mp3?1579524453",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "一人一半？\n\n    保罗和小乐去吃饭，一共花了100元。\n    要买单的时候，小乐说：“我知道你们美国都是AA制，我们也AA吧。”\n    保罗很高兴，说：“好！我们一人一半，那我就出50。”说着，把50元给了服务员。\n    然后，他看到小乐不慌不忙地从包里拿出了一张五折优惠券……",
    "traditional": "一人一半？\n\n    保羅和小樂去吃飯，一共花了100元。\n    要買單的時候，小樂說：“我知道你們美國都是AA制，我們也AA吧。”\n    保羅很高興，說：“好！我們一人一半，那我就出50。”說著，把50元給了服務員。\n    然後，他看到小樂不慌不忙地從包裡拿出了一張五折優惠券……"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Half Per Person?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "保罗和小乐去吃饭，一共花了100元。",
      "traditional": "保羅和小樂去吃飯，一共花了100元。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó hé xiǎo lè qù chī fàn yí gòng huā le 2 yuán",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul and Little Le went to have a meal, and spent 100 yuan altogether."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "要买单的时候，小乐说：",
      "traditional": "要買單的時候，小樂說：",
      "pinyin": "yào mǎi dān de shí hou xiǎo lè shuō",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "“我知道你们美国都是AA制，我们也AA吧。”",
      "traditional": "“我知道你們美國都是AA制，我們也AA吧。”",
      "pinyin": "wǒ zhī dào nǐ men měi guó dōu shì A A zhì wǒ men yě a a ba",
      "english": "When the restaurant bill was going to be paid, Little Le said:"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "“I know that all you Americans split the bill, so let’s also split it.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "保罗很高兴，说：“好！我们一人一半，那我就出50。”",
      "traditional": "保羅很高興，說：“好！我們一人一半，那我就出50。”",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó hěn gāo xìng shuō hǎo wǒ men yì rén yí bàn nà wǒ jiù chū 2",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "说着，把50元给了服务员。",
      "traditional": "說著，把50元給了服務員。",
      "pinyin": "shuō zhe bǎ 2 yuán gěi le fú wù yuán",
      "english": "Paul was very happy, and said: “Ok! Each of us pays half, so I’ll just put up 50.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Saying this, he took 50 yuan and gave to the waiter."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "然后，他看到小乐不慌不忙地从包里拿出了一张五折优惠券……",
      "traditional": "然後，他看到小樂不慌不忙地從包裡拿出了一張五折優惠券……",
      "pinyin": "rán hòu tā kàn dào xiǎo lè bù huāng bù máng de cóng bāo lǐ ná chū le yì zhāng wǔ zhé yōu huì quàn",
      "english": ""
    }
  ],
